purpose: React components for UI rendering and user interactions
common_tasks:
  - Adding new UI components
  - Modifying existing component behavior
  - Updating component styling with Tailwind
  - Adding event handlers and user interactions
  - Implementing responsive design
  - Creating reusable component patterns
watch_out_for:
  - NO headers in feed views (user preference)
  - Always test dark mode compatibility
  - Ensure mobile responsiveness
  - Follow existing component patterns
  - Use TypeScript strictly
  - Memoize expensive components
related_files:
  - /src/hooks/* (custom hooks used by components)
  - /src/contexts/* (global state providers)
  - /src/services/* (business logic)
  - /src/types/* (TypeScript interfaces)
test_command: npm run test:unit
key_patterns:
  - Functional components only (no class components)
  - Props interfaces defined above component
  - Hooks at top of component
  - Event handlers before render
  - Tailwind for styling (avoid inline styles)